{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6c0f70af635f27062d71cd4c281d7f52b7be31b82ec62be687eaef8dc8f2089c", "ja": "（今度のステージイベントで、歩がダンスの振り付けを\n担当することになった。でも、少し悩んでいる様子だ）", "zh": "（步在这次舞台活动中负责舞蹈编排。不过，她似乎有些烦恼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1cc84520c19635d1864cca80df22e7654f331972f1ede212e55e78d6e181c252", "ja": "うーん、どんな振り付けがいいのかなー？\nなかなか全体のテーマが絞れなくてさ……。", "zh": "嗯——编什么样的舞蹈动作比较好呢？\n总觉得很难确定整体主题……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c3ab0c203cb6f08b35592ec7fd81fe1a7cf7087c5eaeabd11e4544308c1e3abe", "ja": "{$P$}は、どんなのがいいと思う？\nやっぱりストリート系？　それか、ハウス寄りとか？", "zh": "{$P$}觉得哪种比较好？\n果然还是街舞风？还是偏浩室风一点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1003_p", "source_sha256": "add19f61540e3318957044931b615c925abbd467add023e9bab7a1bd03f2a3c0", "ja": "そうだなぁ……テーマを合わせるのも大事だけど、\n歩のやりたいことを考えた方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "是啊……统一主题固然重要，但我觉得还是考虑一下步想做什么比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "23d6f7ba07df72ba25d579fbb0f61e61e870c300c530f8f6310a54e74732236e", "ja": "アタシのやりたいこと……？　んー、じゃあさ、\nすごくシンプルで、簡単なダンスとかでもいいかな？", "zh": "我想做的事……？嗯——那就，选那种非常简单、即使是简单的舞蹈也可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "65fbcff4edd6aae442d1e744b07c7e92f4cb0ba32bd2f478df56b6d990e27880", "ja": "誰でも真似できる振り付け、みたいな……\nあ、もちろん、カッコよさは妥協しないよ！", "zh": "就是那种谁都能模仿的舞步……啊，当然，帅气方面可不会妥协哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c7d55fd1138d40aca1f9cc601f884777cd239919f3fc8be7d89ebe69514ae968", "ja": "なるほど……それってつまり、ファンやお客さんも\n一緒に踊れるように、ってことか？", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，是希望粉丝和客人也能一起跳，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "56230031cfbf95160e4581cd1180f9fbdb680e23cdaf69510e34faf166d3ac24", "ja": "イエース♪　ダンスには興味はあるけど、難しそう……\nって思ってる人、結構いると思うんだよね。", "zh": "没错♪我觉得应该有不少人对舞蹈感兴趣，却觉得跳舞好像很难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "be6af762a1e03e9f7102dad4ee6dec1b0d479315460fb86bf26d30093d42012f", "ja": "あとは、ちょっと恥ずかしいとか……\n最初の一歩の踏み出し方がわからないって人とか。", "zh": "还有觉得有点害羞，或者不知道该如何迈出第一步的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bf9394cb372c52c360e7009486c72c1f8e62f0214c0d06cd1c0bf882005bcf1a", "ja": "そんな人たちが、思わず真似したくなるような、\nシンプルで楽しめる振り付けに挑戦してみたいんだ！", "zh": "我想挑战一下编出简单又有趣、让那些人也忍不住想跟着学的舞蹈动作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cd72cd268c3c8b39a62d250c88da779f1fe65f1e898a0d6b4dd892cbd39ac3d1", "ja": "見てもらうだけじゃなくて、一緒にダンスを楽しむ……\nうん、歩らしくていいと思うよ！　それでいこう。", "zh": "不只是让人观看，而是一起享受舞蹈……\n嗯，很有歩的风格，我觉得很好！就这么定了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "be867a1bd6324605470ea83df86cf1c8b904722f63b90f3133a7c6765f40a1bd", "ja": "イェーイ♪　やったね！　みんな一緒に踊ったら、\n最高のステージにできると思うんだ。", "zh": "耶♪　太棒啦！我觉得大家一起跳舞的话，\n一定能打造出最棒的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5a0d6e43bd741b72465982b69dc60acdd2900dae4d62172ffb75d296abb1837a", "ja": "それじゃあ{$P$}。\n早速、振り付けを考えるから踊ってみてくれない？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}。\n我马上来想舞蹈动作，你能不能跳给我看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1013_p", "source_sha256": "96de1a5080e95d1eb5a2601cd33e9269c6624c92ed1ead4864d4e768c4e8c085", "ja": "えっ？　今、ここでか？　それはちょっと……。", "zh": "咦？现在、就在这里吗？这有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "509d83e8d895582eb2bdfac04cae02504823d139123b504c76a37269c7f26fc8", "ja": "そうそう！　そういう反応の人でも、\n思わず踊っちゃうようなダンスを目指したいんだよ。", "zh": "对对！我想编出一种即使是有那种反应的人，也会不由自主跳起来的舞蹈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0543_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "235a056cae040039b2e29565a924acbc874c1c0f8e9b9394762cc813913ab488", "ja": "協力よろしく♪　たまには{$P$}とも\n踊りたいしね！　それじゃ……レッツ・ダ～ンス！", "zh": "拜托你配合啦♪ 我偶尔也想和{$P$}一起跳舞呢！那么……一起跳舞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
